  "description": "Full-colour SPI screens: the 1.8\" ST7735 (128 x 160) and the 2.8\" ILI9341 (240 x 320). Draw shapes, text and pictures with the Adafruit GFX functions. Includes Adafruit_ST7735.h, Adafruit_ILI9341.h, Adafruit_ST7789.h and Adafruit_GFX.h. Also a 240 x 240 ST7789, a round GC9A01 (1.28\", for watch faces and gauges) and a 2.13\" e-paper panel (Adafruit_EPD: it keeps its picture with the power off).",
  "category": "Displays",
  "needsApp": "0.4.0",
